"""
Writes the ready-app logo set.

Kept as a script rather than pasted files so the whole set can be regenerated consistently, and so
the geometry and brand colour of each mark sit in one reviewable place.

Every mark is a simplified rendering of the project's own logo in the project's own colour, drawn
here rather than copied from the vendor: no hotlinks, no bundled third-party binaries, and nothing
that changes under us when a vendor moves a file. They carry no background plate, so they sit on the
card's surface in both themes.
"""

